{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"91b4f48ee8bfb8d47968e114705d7577e3039d9b7ac14137f0f248a743fa21e7","ja":"春香さんを抱きとめる琴葉ちゃん！　ありさ\nコレクションの中でも、超超超レアショットですよー!","zh":"紧紧抱住春香小姐的琴叶！这在亚利沙\n的收藏中，也是超超超珍稀的镜头哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c2acc9da188115fd277eb2eab931c7e59b6fd89c9a42da8c84dc6d6d5ab841f9","ja":"おふたりのツーショットでしたら、\nこちらの写真もオススメです！　こちらはですね……。","zh":"如果是两人的合照，\n也很推荐这张照片哦！这张呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fc31d9f9420bf161ea22b7981891e7c50b4e22cca1e6c68f4a0516fa4ff1c87a","ja":"この写真は、台本をチェックしているところね。\nペンは育ちゃんに借りたのよ♪","zh":"这张照片是我在看剧本的时候呢。\n笔是向小育借的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"16055e66931be392ceee9c0705e125836298de2a319cde2f6515d33198bf41c3","ja":"大事なところは、キラキラペンでラインを入れたの！\n目立って覚えやすくなるから！","zh":"重点部分我用闪亮亮笔画了线哦！\n这样很显眼，而且更容易记住！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"55abee911f2e4cb2d025a093eb788046e8036bd7ca69f9ed11089d750127b62f","ja":"ちなみにこの台本、あちらのブースに\n展示されていますが……必見ですよ～っ！","zh":"顺带一提，这本剧本在那个展位\n有展出……绝对不容错过哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"77fa904b34959d4f9e54cca7b984d9f68c89a5e018a4041c936eee3c1ab3d93c","ja":"みなさんが台本に、どんな書き込みをしているか、\nぜひ、確かめてみてくださいっ！！","zh":"请务必去确认一下，\n大家都在剧本上写了些什么吧！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"42198b523c15649dc4cf2e8aba69f62a71eb09a014ce5c2d06246ec07ab22dea","ja":"これも亜利沙ちゃんが撮ってくれた写真なんですよ。\n他のアイドルとのツーショットです！","zh":"这也是亚利沙帮我拍的照片哦。\n是和其他偶像的合照！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f6c233fda4e16df118d223fe6c9edf2e8be4a9635cf7b5ab78246554300eaf8f","ja":"チャンスだったのでつい……！　このアイドルちゃんの\nファンの方もぜひ、じっくり見てくださいっ！","zh":"因为是个好机会，我就忍不住……！这位偶像的\n粉丝也请一定要仔细看看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"d8324b72475a70299d65d55373615854ae9c66a03ab792e952928c5549972708","ja":"（ムフフッ！　ありさの秘蔵写真が\nこんなに喜んでもらえるなんて、最高です～♪）","zh":"（哼哼哼！亚利沙的珍藏照片\n能让大家这么高兴，真是太棒了～♪）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"ca4796657d87f699cffa23debadae380a0416ac6f011625895ca1a9087abe53c","ja":"亜利沙さん、\n写真の説明に夢中になってるね。","zh":"亚利沙小姐\n正入迷地解说着照片呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1551.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"7dc5ad61c9a8a32e66634f38d248b87890b82d5706c0567d1b11270079fddb1a","ja":"想定通りね。それじゃあそろそろ、\n『例の作戦』を実行しましょう。……ウフフ♪","zh":"和预想的一样呢。那么差不多也该\n执行“那个作战”了。……呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
